{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Everyone is about making preparations for the voyage, that is what youre staying here for right?\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:15:58.683000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-19T04:16:05.471000Z","id":"734262234691403796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Apparen'ly so. Ae just arrived in Londontown earlier today, an a big fella offered me a trip t' the New World. Cannae say no to that Ae figger.\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:17:11.625000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-19T04:17:39.083000Z","id":"734262540632064030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Wonderful! What prompted you to accept?\" Fettachini cuts a piece of the pie he made earlier and puts it on a plate","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:18:28.572000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734262863371436144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"He cuts another slice for Gneiss and gestures to it \"Would you like some?\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:18:51.830000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734262960922296441","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"His eyes widen at the sight of the pie, \"Oh aye, please! Hones'ly jus need off the Old Rock. Lookin' ta open a shop. Strike out for meeself.\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:20:14.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734263307531452499","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"I hope we won't be competitors, friend. I'm bound to open a magical consumables store.\" he plates the slice and slides it with a fork to Gneiss","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:21:54.045000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-19T04:22:03.047000Z","id":"734263725187661915","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Its not as if Fettachini looks like the most experienced businessman. He's young and is wearing a colander on his head.","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:24:23.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734264350054809690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Oh no competition here. Ae work the forge. I cannae cook meself outta burlap sack.\" He takes the plate and immediately cuts a slightly too large portion from his slice and shoves it into his face.","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:24:25.121000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734264358846333009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Good to hear! Best of luck to you Mr. .... I'm sorry what was your name?\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:25:02.422000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734264515297935411","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"I am Fettachini, its a pleasure\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:25:11.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734264554321608725","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"He coughs out \"Gneiss,\" slightly choking on his bit of pie.","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:26:17.042000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734264828276768869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Pardon, they call me Gneiss. Pleasures mine.\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:26:38.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734264918328606801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Well if you ever need a tonic, hot meal, or any potion or the like make sure to talk to me\" Fettachini also starts eating his pie","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:27:23.626000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734265107550437389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"If the rest of your wares are half as good as the pie, you can be sure. An' iffen you find need for metalwork, come find me. Ae am happy to help.\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:28:49.256000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734265466708820069","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"\"Once I get my feet under me anyway.\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:29:20.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734265595788525619","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Fettachini smiles broadly at the compliment and nods his head furiously","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:29:27.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734265626604077087","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DIS","id":"362408476372369410","is_bot":0,"username":".disassembly"},"author_id":"362408476372369410","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Gneiss is a shorter earth genasi man, about 5' with a dappled grey skin similar to the rock of his namesake. The sides of his head are shaved, with black braids coming down from the top of his head and a thick but well trimmed beard on his face.","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:31:07.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734266046273421332","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"And then theres Fettachini with his stale breadstick, slotted spoon, and colander","created_at":"2020-07-19T04:32:15.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734266331184103444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
