{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Slowly, Traxim begins to wake. The previous day’s adventures had taken a toll on him and sleep was not easily overcome. His eyes slowly come open and he winces at the light coming through the windows. S headache lingers, likely from all the confusion and opinions about what had occurred at that creepy mansion. After getting up, he helps himself to some leftover pastries and washes his ‘new’ tankard and pole. Then, after some consideration, washes everything they had touched with an extra thorough washing of his hands for good measure. Then he leaves.","created_at":"2020-07-19T15:47:05.468000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734436158993465344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Wren has always been a late sleeper, but she sleeps more now that she is both 12, and away from her parents for the first time. Now, she stirs a bit, seeing the light coming through her window and she sits up in bed. She had tied her hair into 2 French braids the night before and she runs her hands over them, remembering all the fun she had yesterday.","created_at":"2020-07-19T17:15:54.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734458510804385792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Wren gets up, gets dressed in her hunters gear, straps her archers gear onto her back, and laces up her boots. She looks over to <@!366565198284324868> and wonders whether to wake her up or not","created_at":"2020-07-19T17:18:39.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734459202159771710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Vee was tired from last night, having arrived fresh from the road and the onto a short adventure in the sewers late at night. She slept a little later than Wren did, intent on washing out even the idea of sewage from her to the point that the bath water had gone cold by the time she was done.","created_at":"2020-07-19T17:20:45.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734459732525580438","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"“Hey Vee, I’m going to see if I can find anything to hunt in the woods on the outskirts of the city. I’m going to try and get enough meat to sell and make into jerky and smoked meats for the journey. Want to come?”","created_at":"2020-07-19T17:22:38.952000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734460206968340530","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"636015324772171787","content":"Vee rubs some sleep out of her eyes. \"Oh, no, I'm good. I have some shopping to do later too. For the journey, too. I would tell you to stay safe but I've seen you handle your bow.\"","created_at":"2020-07-19T17:24:34.494000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734460691586613378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
